- [ ] **Sign Spark Mail Limited's DPA** (request via dpo@sparkmailapp.com / their legal page). This closes the EU→US transfer point — store the signed copy in `02 - Signed DPAs with subprocessors`.
- [ ] **Classify** Spark in Vanta per Third-Party Mgmt Policy (likely **High** — Workspace mailbox access; arguably Medium given single-user + minimal server-side storage). Record rationale.
